  "description": "ToolUp.Platform.Transport — the lowest tier of the ToolUp SDK: the portable outbound HTTP seam (HttpRequest / HttpResponse / IHttpTransport), the unified RetryPolicy, the transport failure taxonomy and its classifier (429 / 5xx / Retry-After / local refusal), and the generic retry loop. FSharp.Core only and Fable-compilable, so the same source serves a server host and a browser host; no System.Net.Http (the BCL HttpClient adapter lives in ToolUp.Platform.Server).",
